Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:33.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every night, the same dream, the same strange planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are they trying to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:47.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been 34 years since they arrived on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,And not a day passes that the survivors...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,forced to live in barrier cities, do not live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have vowed to end that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I believe my dreams hold the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:03.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,The question is, will I be in time to save the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not move!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's she doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:12.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. We're getting her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:15.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're coming with us.   - Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:18.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn. Let's move, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:28.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two coming through the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire. Those tanks are flammable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ryan, Neil, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?   - There's a life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Not in years.   - There is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Life form or not, I'm taking you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:54.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Arrest me. But I'm not leaving without that life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's one of those days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, the transport won't wait for us much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:23.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me we're not risking our necks for this plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really, it's a weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even call it a weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need a minute to extract it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a minute we do not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Captain, we need to get moving.   - Understood, sergeant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Could you hurry?   - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:43.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Captain?   - Yes, Neil?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:46.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm for "let's get out of here."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I have this, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're surrounded!   - No shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just relax.   - We gotta get to higher ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone, up top!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:12.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:20.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Requesting immediate evac.   - Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're right behind you!   - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You okay?   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:43.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:21.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, why shouldn't I arrest you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:32.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am Dr. Aki Ross. I have clearance to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not without auth...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you realize you risked our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,it was worth your men's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your men?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She thinks you're a man.   - She's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I know you're not a man.   - You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:52.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Funny.   - I want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did it occur to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:57.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,that we would've volunteered had we been given a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody asked you to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have not changed a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:05.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Nice to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Welcome back, captain.   - We're clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's make sure of that.   - I hate getting scanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:21.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's probably worse for us than the Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:25.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,These machines are suspected of causing sterility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:28.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to have a little Neil Jr. Someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:31.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's a spooky thought.   - Quit busting my chops?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's just do this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir.   - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:53.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've gained weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:56.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's upper-body strength. Get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:57.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,My security rating allows me to bypass this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not today it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:06.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:09.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- About this mission? Or that woman?   - Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:18.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're getting scanned just like everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:26.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.95,0:14:28.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,They got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,There must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You came in contact with a Phantom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:35.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Administering treatment shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:38.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What level?   - Blue. Code red in 3- 1 l2 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:42.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to treat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Impossible. We'll transfer him to the treatment center.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:53.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him to the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:10.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Locating pathogens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, look at that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,How much time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:26.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not enough. When he reaches code red, the shield won't hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:29.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Engaging bio-etheric laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:48.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What?   - Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:50.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:53.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've lost contact. Infestation is moving deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tracking.   - There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:58.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Tracking.   - You'll lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,His treatment shield is failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be back to normal in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:01.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doctor, we need to scan you for infestation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:05.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary. I'll take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:09.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,The military impounded my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:21.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's with her?   - What's with her and the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's with her and that stupid plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:37.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forward me everything regarding the five spirits collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:42.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought we weren't supposed to use the "s" word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't get smart with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if that plant does the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:02.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a match. We've found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,The sixth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,You broke nearly every protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:11.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,How long do you think this would have survived outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:16.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are elements in the council and military waiting to shut us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:21.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, 20 years ago, who discovered this energy in the Phantoms? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:26.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,And who proved the same energy source existed in humans and every life form?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:30.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You. You made it possible to harness that energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:32.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,for ovo-pacs, scanners, the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:37.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,The council knows. They trust you. We're so close to proving...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we still need these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:43.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two more pieces and we've solved the puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to be free to find those pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is this?   - Read.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:55.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,"All life is born of Gaia and each life has a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:58.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Each new spirit is housed in a body."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:18:59.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:04.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Through their experiences on Earth, each spirit matures and grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,When the physical body dies...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:12.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,the mature spirit, enriched by life on Earth, returns to Gaia...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:15.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,bringing with it the experiences...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,enabling Gaia to live and grow."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:19.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my old diary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.27,0:19:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wrote that 43 years ago, when I was the age you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:31.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Remember Galileo? They threw him in jail because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:34.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,he said the Earth was not the center of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,That could happen to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:40.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our ideas are unpopular, Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:43.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you have any notes that could be used against you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:44.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,destroy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Keep them up here.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,And stay away from the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:55.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,He saves your life, you save his, this leads to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was young once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:59.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doctor, there is a war going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:02.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,No one's young anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:06.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Members of the council...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:09.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,could you please explain why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Zeus was completed a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:16.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we attack the meteor, we will eliminate the Phantoms at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,General Hein, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:21.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,We voted 6 to 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,to postpone using the Zeus cannon to attack the Leonid Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have re-convened to vote again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:32.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask the director of the Bio-Etheric Center to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Sid, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:35.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:39.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Phantoms' nest is in the Leonid Meteor...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:42.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,that landed here 34 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:47.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you see now are the records of every assault on the meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:51.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Physical attacks have had utterly no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:55.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,This took place three months ago during a full-scale bombardment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:59.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please note the Phantoms outside the meteor are destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:04.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,However, inside, many that were dormant come to life...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:08.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,and as you see, overall Phantom density remains the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,The newly risen aliens respond to the attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:14.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,by burrowing deeper into the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is very interesting to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,because we see the same thing during surgery...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:25.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,when using bio-etheric lasers on Phantom particles, do we not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,The injured particles escape...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:33.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,digging themselves deeper into a patient's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:38.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we increase the laser power to destroy these deeper particles...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:42.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,we have had incidents of further injury to a patient...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:44.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,and in some cases...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:46.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:48.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,What exactly does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.62,0:22:51.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It means there's a very good chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.29,0:22:54.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,the beam from the Zeus cannon will burn the Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:22:55.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Exactly! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.12,0:23:00.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,However, it also means that the beam energy may be too strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:02.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,injuring the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.73,0:23:04.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Injure the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean the Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:10.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I mean...   - You mean the spirit of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:12.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:15.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,the spirit of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did he say what I think he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:22.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing. Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:23.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:25.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,With all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,did you come here to talk about some Gaia theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:32.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,To tell us that the planet is alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:34.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That it has a spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.36,0:23:37.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a fairy tale. We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is not a fairy tale. It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:45.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,So if I point a gun at the Earth and fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:49.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not just making a hole, I'm killing the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Gaia theory has not been proven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:56.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even if Gaia does exist, won't we still have to remove the Phantoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:24:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,If there's a chance of success, we should take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't you agree?   - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,But there is an alternative to the space cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:06.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another method?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:08.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,A means of disabling the Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:10.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.63,0:24:15.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,As we know, the aliens display a distinct energy pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:20.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is a fact that two opposing bio-etheric waves...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:22.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,placed one over the other cancel each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:26.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is theoretically possible to make a wave pattern...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.55,0:24:28.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,in opposition to the Phantom energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:32.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are assembling such a wave and are near completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.29,0:24:33.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Members of the council...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:37.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,gathering plants and animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.49,0:24:40.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,to fight the Phantoms is utter nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.63,0:24:45.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Zeus cannon is a proven, effective weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:48.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,It will kill Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:51.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we afford to wait for some crazy invention...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:55.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,some army of touchy-feely plants and animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:58.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,that offers no evidence that it will destroy the aliens?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.15,0:25:00.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,There is evidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.51,0:25:02.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our partially completed energy wave...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,has stopped Phantom particles from spreading...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.85,0:25:08.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,through an infected patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have evidence that a terminal patient was cured?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.99,0:25:15.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not cured. The wave is not complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:19.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've succeeded in containing the particles safely inside the patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.63,0:25:23.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is the proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:24.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:42.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,You may have bought us some time, but at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:45.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't keep hiding while you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.23,0:25:48.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want what life I have left to mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:52.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,When we find the seventh and eighth spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:55.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we find them. What we need now is luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:58.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Luck has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.01,0:26:01.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Faith and hard work, girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:05.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,because I'll be damned if you're going to die before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.27,0:26:36.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,The council decided to postpone firing the Zeus cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:38.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I put on a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.05,0:26:40.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mind if I tag along?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:42.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll probably get bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.56,0:26:57.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.27,0:27:03.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You're giving me the silent treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:07.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm scanning the city for the seventh spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.42,0:27:20.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.65,0:27:23.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Almost got it.   - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:25.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're gonna strand them for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.26,0:27:27.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, it was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:29.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,This was your idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.86,0:27:31.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're just helping the captain out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's your sense of romance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:36.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've seen how the captain looks at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:42.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's amore, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:47.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's probably just a glitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.35,0:27:51.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Listen, Aki...   - I'm still mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.82,0:27:53.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're mad?   - Leaving your helmet on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.02,0:27:57.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not telling me who you were. That doesn't seem a bit childish?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.46,0:28:01.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was upset when you left for the Zeus Station without a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:04.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now you know what was going on.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:07.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,My operation had to be done in zero grav.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.67,0:28:08.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:12.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was there on a job and you wouldn't even see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.31,0:28:14.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was probably collecting spirit waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:16.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Now I know.   - I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, me too! We're both sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you tell me about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.06,0:28:29.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.82,0:28:32.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,About the spirits you've collected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.19,0:28:36.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was infected by a Phantom during an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:40.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Normally, no one could have survived.   - How did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.37,0:28:44.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Sid created a membrane around the infection, keeping me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:47.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So the first spirit wave was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.41,0:28:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,The second was a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.18,0:28:50.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,A fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:54.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,The third was a deer I found in a wildlife preserve outside Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fourth was a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.82,0:29:00.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever tried to track a sparrow from outer space? It's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.16,0:29:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You'd love that.   - I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then there was that plant I collected from Times Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.56,0:29:09.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I thought that was number six.   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.56,0:29:10.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You skipped one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:18.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fifth was a little girl dying in a hospital emergency room.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:22.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I retrieved the sample in time, but she...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:29.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told her everything had a spirit: Dogs, cats, trees, little girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:31.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Even the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.05,0:29:35.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,I told her she wasn't dying, but returning to the Earth's spirit...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.09,0:29:37.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,to Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.49,0:29:44.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,She told me that she was ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.80,0:29:52.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,She said I didn't have to make up stories to make her feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.91,0:29:58.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only 7 years old and ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:05.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have work to do. I have to find the seventh and eighth spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.12,0:30:08.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:11.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't believe any of this, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:14.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just don't know, Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.47,0:30:21.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this why you shut me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:23.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should have told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.51,0:30:27.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much time I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.58,0:30:29.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Who does?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I better get back to scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.47,0:30:54.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain Edwards...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:59.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,you extracted a Dr. Ross from Old New York several days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.04,0:31:03.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir.   - What were your impressions of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:06.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,She seemed very capable and determined, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:10.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and the Deep Eyes are being temporarily reassigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.52,0:31:14.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You will guard Dr. Ross when she reenters the wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.96,0:31:15.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:18.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't understand yet, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Report any aberrant behavior in Dr. Ross to the major immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.10,0:31:24.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aberrant behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.53,0:31:29.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,She carries an alien infestation. We don't know what it's doing to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:32.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,It might affect her judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.51,0:31:35.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,They may be manipulating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:39.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is the general suggesting that Dr. Ross is a spy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:44.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,The general is wondering why he's explaining himself to a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:47.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's had prolonged exposure to Phantom tissue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.75,0:31:50.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,If this begins to manifest itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.66,0:31:55.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,she is to be placed under arrest and transported here for observation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:59.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,It is, in fact, for her own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.10,0:32:01.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:13.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Major, send some of our men to keep an eye on the good captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.21,0:33:52.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced these dreams are some form of communication.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The message still eludes me...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.25,0:33:59.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,but they're coming faster now and that can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.22,0:34:03.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Phantoms inside me are beginning to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.39,0:34:06.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our target is 50 klicks west of Tucson.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:08.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Phantom concentration?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.46,0:34:10.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not good. We've got big metas everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.10,0:34:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a real picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.17,0:34:16.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stick close. No heroics today. Everything by the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.14,0:34:18.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,By the book. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.58,0:34:29.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we drop energy buoys here, here and here...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:33.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,we can acquire the target and get out before they know we were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.35,0:34:35.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,The buoys attract the Phantoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:37.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.   - For a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.13,0:34:50.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're from the 307 th? Under General Hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.54,0:34:54.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ever done wasteland recon before? It can get pretty ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.27,0:35:26.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, rendezvous for evac at vector 6, coordinate 279.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.67,0:35:30.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Roger. Stay alert for hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:50.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like they've taken the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:09.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,The seventh spirit should be just beyond that line of wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:12.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,How could any living thing survive here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.85,0:36:15.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll find out soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.82,0:36:19.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,This was the Phantom Cleansing Mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.86,0:36:22.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to end the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:27.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,My father's in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.57,0:36:31.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.31,0:36:34.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move out, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:51.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:52.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,A survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:55.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's it doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.90,0:36:57.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hoping for life to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:00.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that our spirit, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.87,0:37:03.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.08,0:37:19.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're closing in on the life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.05,0:37:24.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Distance?   - Hard to say. We're very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:35.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not gonna tell me it's him?   - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.88,0:37:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's his ovo-pac.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.88,0:37:49.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,How? The pacs power our weapons, the barrier cities...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.98,0:37:51.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just bio-etheric energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.95,0:37:55.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,To create that energy we use living tissue. Single-cell organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.59,0:37:58.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,- His backpack is the seventh spirit?   - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.63,0:38:00.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have incoming. Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:01.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.03,0:38:03.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:06.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ryan, get the soldier's pac.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.52,0:38:25.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need a hand! Sarge!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.96,0:38:33.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Those buoys? They're not working.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right?   - Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.37,0:38:46.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,This shouldn't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.64,0:38:48.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something's attracting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.88,0:38:50.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:57.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're closing in fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.65,0:38:59.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, take the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:15.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.15,0:39:29.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get us out of here, Neil.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'd love to, but...   - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.55,0:39:59.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.45,0:40:03.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:05.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to get her to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.85,0:40:09.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You have your orders, sir.   - What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:13.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Ross is to be taken into custody now, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:19.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lower your weapons. That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.90,0:40:21.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,We relieve you of your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.10,0:40:24.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll have to shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:26.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stand down, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.29,0:41:52.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.13,0:42:01.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deep Eyes, hard to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:27.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Neil, get us back to New York, fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.40,0:42:41.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Deep Eyes are returning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.61,0:42:43.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,There was an incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.51,0:42:46.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,It would seem the Phantoms were attracted to Dr. Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.55,0:42:49.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,The crew barely escaped with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.02,0:42:52.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain Edwards is still in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.72,0:42:54.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Issue an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.42,0:42:57.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want Edwards and Dr. Ross placed under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.59,0:43:00.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,All research materials pertaining to Dr. Sid's wave theory...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.13,0:43:02.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,are to be confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.96,0:43:05.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,That might not go over well with the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.03,0:43:08.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy that would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:12.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is perfect. The good captain has opened the door for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.74,0:43:16.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,The council will be at our feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.41,0:43:19.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,thanking us for exposing the traitors and imploring us...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.05,0:43:22.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,to save them from the Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.82,0:43:28.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is she, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:32.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She is dying.   - There must be something you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.99,0:43:35.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki is fighting with only six of the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.50,0:43:38.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have to implant the seventh directly into her chest plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.73,0:43:41.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it might be damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.67,0:43:43.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to repair this panel quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.67,0:43:49.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her vital signs are dropping. Aki is slipping away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.08,0:43:54.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,She needs a sympathetic spirit to help hold her in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.81,0:43:59.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can think of none better suited for that task than yours, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.69,0:44:03.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't understand.   - You don't have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.86,0:44:05.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just be with her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.99,0:44:09.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,You keep her here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki? Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.72,0:45:05.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,On an alien planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:07.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.06,0:45:11.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not entirely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.46,0:45:12.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You seem pretty calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.19,0:45:16.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been having this dream every night for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.63,0:45:17.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.23,0:45:20.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.27,0:45:24.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're really here, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.67,0:45:27.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.21,0:45:33.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid is implanting the seventh spirit directly into your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.21,0:45:35.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you're my spiritual support.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.12,0:45:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray, how sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:43.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't think you realize how serious this situation is.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.73,0:45:49.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Something you should see here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:59.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I am watching what, major?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.37,0:46:02.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems Dr. Ross has been recording her dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.04,0:46:05.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,And why would I be interested in...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.05,0:46:08.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,her dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.75,0:46:10.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is it. This is our evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.12,0:46:13.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's under the influence of the Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:23.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The dreams should be all the council needs to authorize the Zeus cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.30,0:46:26.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,The council is content to hide inside this barrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.83,0:46:29.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,while the world dies more every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:32.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,They need a push in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.61,0:46:35.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get together a group of your most trusted men.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.19,0:47:29.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are they staring at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.56,0:47:31.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.68,0:48:23.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.39,0:48:27.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.52,0:48:30.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,How is she, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.36,0:48:32.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine. But this is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.83,0:48:36.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll need to find the eighth and final spirit to cure her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:42.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.37,0:48:45.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I finished it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.21,0:48:48.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what the Phantoms really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody move! You're all under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.46,0:49:07.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have them, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.16,0:49:10.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.80,0:49:12.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,My wife and daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.13,0:49:19.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,were killed by Phantoms in the San Francisco Barrier City.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.97,0:49:21.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I ever tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.48,0:49:28.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,I try to imagine what that must have been like...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.48,0:49:32.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,seeing everyone around you fall over dead for no apparent reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.99,0:49:37.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then, at the end, feeling something next to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.36,0:49:39.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,invisible...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.46,0:49:41.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,touching you...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.96,0:49:45.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,reaching inside your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.83,0:49:49.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've lost family, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.50,0:49:51.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.17,0:49:54.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.17,0:49:56.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.84,0:49:59.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what must be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.92,0:50:09.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Security override.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.49,0:50:12.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Perimeter breach.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.73,0:50:15.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Major, arrest these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:19.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take it easy.   - Stand up. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.80,0:50:23.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are relieved of your post. Don't ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.37,0:50:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Reduce power to Sector 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.37,0:50:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,You realize that the Phantoms...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.58,0:50:31.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,What I realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.21,0:50:35.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,is we must force the council to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.65,0:50:44.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,25% of energy pipe alpha redirected.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.69,0:50:48.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lowering power output to Sector 31.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.73,0:50:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Barrier breach in Sector 31. They're coming through now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.07,0:50:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can handle a few Phantoms in a contained space.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.24,0:51:02.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Relax, major. When this night's over, you're going to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.44,0:51:07.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't...   - But you saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.75,0:51:10.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what I saw. How can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:12.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, please, let her continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.92,0:51:16.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why do you think we've never been able to determine...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.89,0:51:21.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,a relationship between the human-sized Phantoms and the giant ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.53,0:51:25.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, doc, but what frigging relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.26,0:51:29.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You got your human-sized Phantoms, creepy caterpillary Phantoms...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:32.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,flying Phantoms and my favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.74,0:51:34.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,the big, fat, giant Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.54,0:51:35.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.74,0:51:38.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you've spent time in the field...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.74,0:51:42.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,you know there is no relationship. It's like a zoo out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.45,0:51:45.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think the giant ones are like our whales or elephants.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.19,0:51:50.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,But why would an invading army bring whales and elephants along?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.82,0:51:53.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unless their ship was a crazy Noah's Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.19,0:51:56.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have always assumed that the meteor...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.86,0:52:00.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,was intended as a form of transportation. Perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.60,0:52:03.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,The meteor is a chunk of their planet that got thrown into space...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.67,0:52:04.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,when they destroyed their world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.14,0:52:09.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,But how could they survive the trip across outer space?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.81,0:52:11.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.05,0:52:17.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,This makes a creepy kind of sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.95,0:52:19.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.99,0:52:23.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think that explains why we never had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.96,0:52:27.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,All our strategies are based on one assumption:
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.73,0:52:30.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,That we were fighting alien invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:33.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Think of the dream, Gray. How they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.90,0:52:36.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since then, all they've known is suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.90,0:52:38.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not an invading army.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.00,0:52:40.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.58,0:52:43.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,How many Phantoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.04,0:52:45.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,More than enough to convince the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.08,0:52:50.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excellent. Sound an alert. Send a squad out to eliminate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.68,0:52:53.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alert status. Full deployment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.42,0:52:55.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have numerous Phantom contacts!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.42,0:52:56.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.06,0:52:59.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Outside of Sector 31 and moving at incredible speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.19,0:53:01.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.19,0:53:03.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're in the pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:06.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're moving with the bio-etheric energy flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.53,0:53:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. Nothing could survive in those pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.90,0:53:14.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've got a big one heading this way. Meta class, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.35,0:53:23.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.42,0:53:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.43,0:54:14.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.19,0:54:39.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Neil. We need a way out. You're our man. Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.73,0:54:43.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,These walls are titanium alloy and the bars are pulse-sonic lasers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.83,0:54:47.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not like I can just wave a magic wand and...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:53.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Neil, I'm impressed.   - That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:56.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Proceed to the nearest evacuation facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.94,0:54:58.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Proceed to the nearest evacuation facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.18,0:55:02.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We should proceed to the nearest evacuation facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.37,0:55:30.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Here they come.   - But the others! Dr. Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.21,0:55:32.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Deep Eyes'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.99,0:55:42.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can we see them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.32,0:55:45.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,They must be carrying a residual charge from the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.66,0:55:51.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.06,0:56:55.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,All aboard, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.46,0:58:04.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to find my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.70,0:58:07.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it was towed here, it would be in the military hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.60,0:58:09.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a big "if."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.31,0:58:19.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.39,0:58:29.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get us onto the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.41,0:58:49.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.51,0:58:51.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going through the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.54,0:58:53.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,With all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.31,0:58:55.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Excuse me, captain.   - The station.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.58,0:58:57.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.32,0:58:58.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.18,0:59:02.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I gather this will be somewhat of a rough ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.82,0:59:05.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got a talent for understatement.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.59,0:59:07.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.88,0:59:32.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.56,0:59:38.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.32,0:59:41.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Anybody hurt?   - Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.96,0:59:48.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Talk to me, sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.97,0:59:49.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.20,0:59:51.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Give me a hand.   - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.74,0:59:55.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're risking further injury. We need the proper tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.97,0:59:57.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're in my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.74,1:00:02.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No. No, doc. No drugs.   - Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.38,1:00:03.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.38,1:00:05.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.15,1:00:07.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll stay with him.   - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:09.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody's staying.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.92,1:00:12.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just give me a gun.   - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.09,1:00:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Give him a weapon. Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.13,1:00:19.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll be back for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.23,1:00:21.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.63,1:00:24.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hear you, captain. Now, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.34,1:00:26.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.66,1:01:20.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,A quad-axle ATV. This is good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.26,1:01:24.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It can be used to retrieve Ryan and bring him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.53,1:01:27.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll need to replace these spent fuel cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.00,1:01:30.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,There could be some live ovo-pacs in the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.84,1:01:33.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Check the hangar. Neil, get us ready for takeoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.01,1:01:35.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki and Dr. Sid, prep the Quatro.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.14,1:01:38.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll go rotate the airtray.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.68,1:01:43.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,This city may be lost, but we are not. Let's do this and get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.26,1:01:56.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.56,1:01:57.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.21,1:02:41.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.96,1:02:58.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Neil, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.72,1:03:00.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Loud and clear, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.49,1:03:02.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,This baby'll fly itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.84,1:03:11.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Flight path is set.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.34,1:03:12.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Beginning rotation.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.31,1:03:18.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop the airtray. We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.78,1:03:21.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,An impound tractor is attached to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.58,1:03:23.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you disengage from the cockpit?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.02,1:03:26.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Permission to go outside and detach the coupling.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.52,1:03:28.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.17,1:03:41.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.64,1:03:53.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,The controls are locked, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.05,1:03:59.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think we'll get out of here alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.68,1:04:01.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anybody else has gotten out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.05,1:04:04.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,You think anyone's made it this far?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.82,1:04:07.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will this eighth-spirit stuff work against the Phantoms?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.99,1:04:10.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What if it's all mumbo-jumbo?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.33,1:04:16.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can we stop talking? I'm trying to concentrate here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.68,1:04:33.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing we can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.10,1:04:48.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Neil, what's your status?   - Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.53,1:04:50.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.27,1:04:54.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're fine. Jane is negotiating with extreme prejudice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.21,1:04:55.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Talk to me, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.04,1:04:59.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,No problem here, captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.68,1:05:07.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! Captain, we are good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.43,1:05:49.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jane, get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.46,1:05:52.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of there now! Go! Jane!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.76,1:05:54.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.06,1:06:24.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,The shield is powered and ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.96,1:06:26.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?   - To the cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.53,1:06:29.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're in countdown to liftoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.83,1:06:33.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, wait. It's too dangerous. Aki!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.06,1:06:59.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over here, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.15,1:08:28.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray, do you read me? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.92,1:08:31.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,You and Sid are getting out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.29,1:08:34.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No! We can't just leave everyone.   - Everyone's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.79,1:08:38.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not leaving without you.   - Sorry, but you don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.67,1:08:42.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Aki.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.81,1:09:22.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.10,1:11:28.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.13,1:11:33.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wish I could believe they were in a better place.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.20,1:13:45.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I enlarged the scanning perimeter...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.27,1:13:48.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,to include an area that we had previously overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.24,1:13:50.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,The impact crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.08,1:13:53.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Strange place to find the eighth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.38,1:13:55.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, really quite astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:57.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,But nothing could survive in there except Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.72,1:13:58.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.22,1:14:02.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which suggests that the eighth spirit is a Phantom spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.59,1:14:05.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it at the moment, but once we get down there...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.99,1:14:09.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,- you will understand...   - Wait, doctor. That's a one-way trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.53,1:14:12.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I expected that's how you would evaluate our chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.80,1:14:14.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.47,1:14:15.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I agree. We probably...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.00,1:14:19.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,won't live long enough to extract the eighth spirit from the crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.47,1:14:21.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then why even try it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.24,1:14:23.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because we don't need to extract the eighth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.51,1:14:25.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,If we can't bring the final spirit here...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.51,1:14:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,we can go there and complete the wave inside the crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.31,1:14:29.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.95,1:14:31.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,And how do we do that, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.32,1:14:34.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can construct a device that...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.42,1:14:38.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,would attach to Aki's chest plate to gather the eighth spirit and...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.86,1:14:40.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.36,1:14:44.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then we wait and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.13,1:14:46.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.93,1:14:49.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's your plan? We wait and see what happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.54,1:14:54.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, good. Well, I got my own plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.84,1:14:56.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,We keep scanning the surface from orbit...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.71,1:14:59.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,and maybe we'll find a compatible spirit somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.98,1:15:02.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say we go in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.48,1:15:35.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,What caused the barrier to fail, General Hein?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.01,1:15:38.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it was only a matter of time...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.05,1:15:42.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,before the Phantoms developed an immunity to our barriers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.69,1:15:45.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,But I am relieved to see that you and the council...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.36,1:15:48.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,were able to evacuate to Houston without incident.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.06,1:15:51.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a terrible loss suffered this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:54.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,The council has reconsidered your proposal to fire the Zeus cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.23,1:15:56.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.83,1:15:59.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,We are transmitting the access codes to you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.04,1:16:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,And, general...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.71,1:16:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,best of luck to us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.91,1:16:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the cannon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.62,1:16:11.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,The target, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:15.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Phantom crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.85,1:16:46.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Preparing to drop in three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.76,1:16:52.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Powering the shield.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.46,1:16:57.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're over the meteor.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.43,1:16:59.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have it in sight, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.90,1:17:02.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.57,1:17:05.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.64,1:17:09.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm tracking the eighth spirit along the crater's surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.31,1:17:13.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Now let's take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.68,1:17:55.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready to fire in three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.62,1:17:59.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ovo-pacs at maximum. Transferring plasma flow to auto.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.89,1:18:01.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Counter-thrusters are engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.16,1:18:04.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lox flow de-coupled. Status is green.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.16,1:18:08.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have something on radar over the impact site, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.14,1:18:12.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.70,1:18:13.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.01,1:18:16.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just a traitor under the influence of the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.74,1:18:18.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Continue the countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.71,1:18:21.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll take them all out at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.08,1:18:29.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're closing on the Phantom. Contact in 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.39,1:18:31.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Target locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.09,1:18:34.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready to fire on your command.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.56,1:18:41.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a match! It's a perfect match!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.37,1:18:43.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Scanners ready.   - Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.37,1:19:19.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.54,1:19:22.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the Zeus. They're firing on the crater.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.27,1:19:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right?   - A little shaken. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.91,1:19:30.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid, the eighth spirit is not on our scanner. Do you have it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.98,1:19:32.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,The eighth spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.72,1:19:35.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.85,1:19:37.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,What will we do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.85,1:19:39.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nothing. This mission is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.96,1:19:41.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Let's get out of here.   - Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.56,1:20:15.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.56,1:20:18.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're getting us out, you better do it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.78,1:20:31.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.22,1:20:43.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.86,1:20:50.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Unable to maintain altitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.40,1:21:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emergency landing procedures.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.79,1:21:26.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in. Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.46,1:21:29.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Aki, Gray, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.57,1:21:33.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to the station. Can you patch us through?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.94,1:21:38.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is that thing?   - I don't know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.11,1:21:41.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Incoming message, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.61,1:21:44.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,General Hein, cease fire immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.32,1:21:48.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What you're seeing is the living spirit of an alien's home world.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.82,1:21:51.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Their planet was destroyed and landed here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.69,1:21:54.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not an invasion. It never was.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.63,1:21:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see. What have we been fighting all this time? Ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.16,1:22:00.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.30,1:22:03.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Spirits that are confused, lost and angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.00,1:22:06.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Right. And these spirits are coming out of this Gaia thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.94,1:22:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have to listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.77,1:22:12.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alien Gaia, Earth Gaia. Even if I believed that...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.61,1:22:15.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,the Earth's under attack from an aggressor...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.65,1:22:17.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,who must be destroyed at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.22,1:22:20.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,The cost may be the entire planet, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.95,1:22:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Firing on the alien Gaia will only make it stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.95,1:22:28.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since you're under the alien's influence, I'll take it that we're...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.59,1:22:30.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,taking the correct action.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.76,1:22:35.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,So take your last few moments and prepare to meet your Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.40,1:22:38.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Continue to fire until the invader has been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.11,1:23:17.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,General, the system's overheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.44,1:23:21.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll hit again and keep on hitting it until it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.55,1:23:24.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,But we're not even sure if it's having any effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.35,1:23:27.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,No effect? We've got them on the run, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.95,1:23:31.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is our moment of victory. I order you to fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.19,1:23:36.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,- The system won't allow us to fire.   - We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.29,1:23:41.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our shield is out. We're sitting ducks. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.09,1:24:05.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is not a good place to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.63,1:24:16.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that? Is it what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.90,1:24:18.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.40,1:24:20.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is definitely not a good place to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.14,1:24:24.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.48,1:24:28.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I have to talk to Dr. Sid.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.95,1:25:09.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sid, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.22,1:25:12.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.62,1:25:16.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We're looking at Gaia. Do you hear me, Sid? Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.16,1:25:21.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,This explains why the eighth spirit appeared here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.37,1:25:23.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.03,1:25:25.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.00,1:25:28.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Phantom changed into the eighth spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.04,1:25:31.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,at touching a life born from our own Gaia.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.08,1:25:35.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,It would've gotten a different energy signature...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.51,1:25:38.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,that set it apart from the other Phantoms.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.88,1:25:41.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have hoped for a better location...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:44.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,to find a new compatible spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.49,1:25:48.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't move. Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.96,1:25:53.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Staying where we are isn't as easy as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.00,1:25:56.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot any of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.37,1:25:59.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could very well destroy our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.37,1:26:02.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest? Ask them to play nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.67,1:26:06.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Combat strategy is your area of expertise, captain, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.05,1:26:10.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have a reading in the fissure. See it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.78,1:26:15.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes! A compatible spirit. It must be very near you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.85,1:26:17.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well? Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.22,1:26:19.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.56,1:26:23.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to narrow down. Just a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.60,1:26:29.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's getting crowded in here. Aki, we don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.23,1:28:03.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,With the hope of new life...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.76,1:28:06.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,has Gaia changed the Phantom within?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.87,1:28:14.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.41,1:28:23.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray, get in here. I need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.01,1:28:27.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hear me, Sid? The wave pattern is complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.25,1:28:30.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I read you. This is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.72,1:28:33.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't see how you found the final spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.86,1:28:36.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,It found me, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.06,1:28:39.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.96,1:28:44.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,I see now. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.27,1:28:46.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.07,1:28:49.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,The ovo-pac will project the wave.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.27,1:28:52.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,- But we'll be defenseless.   - Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.74,1:28:54.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.02,1:28:57.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll use it to project the wave.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.35,1:29:00.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dr. Sid was right. I have it. The eighth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.05,1:29:02.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm cured, Gray.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.62,1:29:05.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure you have it?   - Yes, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.09,1:29:09.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- How can you know?   - Don't worry. A Phantom told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.49,1:29:11.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.46,1:29:13.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it. Shield on.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.44,1:29:22.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not working. We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.57,1:29:25.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,If this doesn't work, then it's already too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.65,1:29:35.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.98,1:30:01.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll blast you all to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.52,1:30:11.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.53,1:30:16.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.24,1:30:32.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Warning. System overload.   - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.48,1:30:35.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Warning. System overload.   - I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.78,1:30:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,But it must be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.50,1:31:26.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.73,1:31:28.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.50,1:31:30.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.78,1:32:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me, Gray.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.22,1:32:54.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Told Sid this was a one-way trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.72,1:32:57.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Looks like I was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.69,1:33:00.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Gray. Hang on, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.26,1:33:02.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I still have the wave.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.39,1:33:04.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can get through this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.27,1:33:11.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We won't make it.   - We will make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.80,1:33:13.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,We both know that isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.38,1:33:28.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.10,1:33:40.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.10,1:33:45.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,You saved my life once. Now I want you to save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.47,1:33:47.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Gray, no. Please?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.44,1:33:50.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me do this, Aki. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.62,1:34:02.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me, Gray.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.52,1:34:05.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been saying that death isn't the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.66,1:34:10.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't back out on me now that I finally believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.44,1:34:23.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.15,1:36:15.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:44.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,《最终幻想：灵魂深处》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,(2065年12月13日 录下梦境)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.16,0:02:33.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,每天晚上,同样的梦境,同样奇怪的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:35.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是为什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:37.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们想告诉我什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:47.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们来到这个星球34年了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:49.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,被逼住在堡垒城市的幸存者...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有一天不是在活在恐惧中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:56.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓要解除这恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:58.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信我的梦就是钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:03.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,问题是,我来得及拯救地球吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,(旧纽约市)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:10.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,她在这儿干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道,我们得带她离开这
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:15.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你得跟我们走  - 小心后面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:18.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:28.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,两只从墙穿过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,停火,那些桶子是易燃物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,莱恩、尼尔,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么?  - 有一个生物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 早就没有了  - 现在就有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管有没有,我都要带你走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:54.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,逮捕我啊,没有这生物我不会离开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天衰毙了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,运输机是不会等我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,它的状况很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:23.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我,我们不是为了这烂植物在送死
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:25.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的咧,是杂草
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:27.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看连杂草都不算
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:29.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我一分钟去萃取它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们连一分钟都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说得没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.76,0:09:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽怪来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:40.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 队长,我们得快走  - 知道了,中士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:42.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 拜托你快点  - 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:43.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 队长  - 什么事,尼尔?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.87,0:09:46.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得咱们应该闪人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:47.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,请把枪给我,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们被包围了  - 废话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 大伙儿别紧张  - 我们得往高处逃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿快走,往上走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走...快走...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:20.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 请求立刻撤退  - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.50,0:10:22.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们就在你后面  - 快来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.05,0:10:40.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:43.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,大伙儿,它们来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.73,0:11:21.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.13,0:11:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说我为什么不该逮捕你?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是罗安琪博士,我有到此的许可证
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:34.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有授权...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:36.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你争
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白我们在为你冒险吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,事实是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这值得你跟你的弟兄冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.32,0:11:45.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么弟兄?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.69,0:11:47.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她以为你是男人  - 她是猪头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你不是男人  - 你也是猪头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:52.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好好笑  - 让我告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有想过...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:57.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们若有选择,是否会志愿送死?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人叫你们救我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一点也没变
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.47,0:12:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,葛雷?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,我也很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.45,0:12:31.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,(42号堡垒城市 纽约市)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎归队,队长  - 我们没有被感染
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:18.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们最好确定一下  - 我最讨厌接受扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:21.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,扫描机搞不好比幽怪更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:25.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人怀疑这玩意会造成不孕症
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.69,0:13:28.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要个小尼尔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:31.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 太恐怖了吧  - 你干嘛老找我碴?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,废话少说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:35.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:36.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是,长官  - 是,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.84,0:13:49.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:53.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你变胖了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.72,0:13:56.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这叫上体位力量,交个女朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:57.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在努力泡美眉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的保安级别让我有豁免权
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:06.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:09.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这项任务或是那女的?  - 都是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,我想...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:18.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要跟别人一样接受扫描
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:26.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.95,0:14:28.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,他受到感染
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.25,0:14:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你接触到幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:35.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动治疗防护罩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:38.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么程度感染?  - 蓝色,3分半钟后红色警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:42.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,必须立刻替他治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,他要转到治疗中心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:53.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他抬上手术台
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,撑着点,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:10.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,搜寻病原体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,天啊,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:21.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有多少时间?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:26.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,不多了,达到红色警戒,这个罩子就无法控制病毒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:29.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动生化雷射枪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:48.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事?  - 它跑哪儿了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:50.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:53.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,失去踪影,病毒侵入身体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:55.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 追踪  - 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:58.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快追踪  - 来不及了,他会死的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.61,0:16:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,防护罩失效了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:50.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:56.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很快就会恢复的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:17:01.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士,你必须接受扫描看是否有感染
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:05.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没有必要,我愿意负责
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.41,0:17:09.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你救了他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,军方扣留我的船
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:21.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她是怎么回事?  - 她跟队长是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.12,0:17:25.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她跟那根烂草是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.20,0:17:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,把所有搜集到的五个灵魂的资料给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:38.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:42.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为我们不该用灵魂一词
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.01,0:17:45.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,别跟我耍嘴皮子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们看看那根植物有没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:55.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,(萃取植物能量波)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.69,0:17:58.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,(比对能量波)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:02.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全符合,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.30,0:18:03.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,第六魂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.87,0:18:08.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你几乎违反了所有的规定
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:11.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想这根草在外面还能活多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:16.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会和军方有些份子等着要关闭我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:21.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着,谁在20年前找到幽怪的能量波?你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:26.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁证明每种生物都有这能量?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:30.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你使人能够控制这种能量...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.43,0:18:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,把它用在生化电池扫描机和堡垒城上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:37.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会很清楚,他们相信你,我们就快能证明...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:39.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们仍所需要这些部分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:43.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,只缺两个就能解开谜底
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到它们的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你看样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么?  - 读吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.61,0:18:55.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有生命来自盖雅,而每个生命都有灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:58.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,每个新灵魂都住在一个肉体内
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:18:59.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,读下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:04.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,依据他们在地球上的经验,每个灵魂不断成长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:07.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,当肉体老死后...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:12.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,经过生命洗礼的成熟灵魂...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:15.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,将带着这些经验...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:18.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,回归于盖雅,让盖雅存活并成长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.27,0:19:19.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的旧日记
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.27,0:19:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,43年前我还像你这个年纪的时候写的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,席德博士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:31.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,记得伽利略的下场吗?他被关进牢狱...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.79,0:19:34.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为他说地球不是宇宙中心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也可能发生在我们的身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:40.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的主张并不受欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你有对自己不利的资料...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:44.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,快毁掉它们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 记在脑子里  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,离队长远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他救了你,你也救了他,别被冲昏了头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也年轻过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:59.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士,有一场战争正在进行中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.31,0:20:02.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在再没有年轻人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:06.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位议员...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:09.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们能解释为什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,宙斯炮一个月前完工
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:16.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果用来攻击陨石,就能彻底消灭幽怪的巢穴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,海恩将军,请冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.43,0:21:21.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,上次我们六比二票决定...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,暂缓利用宙斯炮攻击李纳陨石
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,这次要再投票表决
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:32.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想请生化能量中心主任发言
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.07,0:21:34.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,席德博士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.24,0:21:35.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:39.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家知道幽怪巢穴是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.91,0:21:42.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,34年前坠落地球的李纳陨石
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:47.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是至今每次攻击陨石的记录
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:51.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,猛烈攻击完全无法造成损害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:55.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,三个月前进行全面性轰炸行动
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:59.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,陨石外的幽怪确实被歼灭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:04.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是潜伏在内的幽怪却复苏...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:08.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,而你可以看到,幽怪的密度仍然跟以前一样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:11.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,当复苏的幽怪遭到攻击...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:14.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,便钻入地球的更深层
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:17.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一点相当有趣...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:20.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们使用生化雷射...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.96,0:22:25.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,切除幽怪病毒时也是这样,对不对?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,受伤的病毒脱逃后...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:33.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,会钻入病患更深的体内
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:38.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们为了消灭这些在更深层的病毒而加强雷射量...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.81,0:22:42.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾意外地造成病患更大的伤害...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.98,0:22:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,有时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.01,0:22:46.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,导致死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.51,0:22:48.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,这代表了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.62,0:22:51.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这代表一件事...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.29,0:22:54.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,宙斯炮会消灭幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:22:55.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就对了,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.12,0:23:00.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是,那同时代表威力强大的雷射炮...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:02.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,也会伤害地球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.73,0:23:04.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,伤害地球?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:07.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说盖雅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.20,0:23:10.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我是说...  - 你说的是地灵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.47,0:23:15.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,地球的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说了我认为他说的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:22.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我在做什么,你千万别说话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:23.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.19,0:23:25.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是来高谈盖雅论吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.69,0:23:32.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说地球是活的?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:34.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,它有灵魂?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.36,0:23:37.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是神话,我们没有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.37,0:23:39.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是神话,这是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:45.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我拿着枪朝地上开一枪...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:49.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不只射穿一个洞还杀了地球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:51.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,盖雅论未经证实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:56.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,就算盖雅存在,我们不是还是得消灭幽怪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.18,0:24:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果有成功机会,就要把握
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:02.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不同意吗?  - 当然同意
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.89,0:24:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,但太空战炮以外有另一个选择
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.63,0:24:06.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,有另一个方法?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.96,0:24:08.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有一个瘫痪幽灵的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.56,0:24:10.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,请说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.63,0:24:15.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,据我们所知,这些异形散发一种能量波
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要把两道相反的生化波...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.31,0:24:22.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,重叠在一起就能互相抵消
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.08,0:24:26.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,理论上可以重建一道能量波...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.55,0:24:28.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,和幽怪的能量波完全相反
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:32.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正在制造这种波,而且快要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.29,0:24:33.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,各位议员...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.09,0:24:37.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,搜集植物和动物...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.49,0:24:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,去对抗幽怪简直是无稽之谈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.63,0:24:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,宙斯炮证实是威力强大的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.30,0:24:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,它能消灭幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:51.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是否可以负担的起去...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.44,0:24:55.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,等待一些毫无可以摧毁...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.91,0:24:58.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,异型证据的什么动植物兵团?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.15,0:25:00.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然有证据
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.51,0:25:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,目前半完成的能量波...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,抑止幽怪病毒...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.85,0:25:08.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一名受感染病患身上扩散
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有证明有名垂死病患痊愈的证据?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.99,0:25:15.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是痊愈,能量波尚未完成
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.33,0:25:19.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们成功地控制了病毒的扩散
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.63,0:25:23.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,证据在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:24.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:42.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也许让我们有多一点时间,但是代价呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:45.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能一直躲起来让你维护我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.23,0:25:48.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想在余生有所贡献
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我们找到第七和第八魂...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:55.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要运气才可以找到它们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.00,0:25:58.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这跟运气无关
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.01,0:26:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要有信心和努力...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:05.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我绝不会让你比我先死
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.27,0:26:36.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会决定暂缓发射宙斯炮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:38.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我的表现还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.05,0:26:40.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,介意我跟来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:42.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会觉得无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.56,0:26:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.27,0:27:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道了,你在跟我冷战
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.07,0:27:07.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要在市内搜索第七魂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.42,0:27:20.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼尔,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.65,0:27:23.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安啦,就快好了  - 你在搞什么鬼?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:25.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把他们卡在上面一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.26,0:27:27.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,别看我,这是他的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你的点子?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.86,0:27:31.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是想帮队长的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:33.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,浪漫情调哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:36.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到队长看她的眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是"爱",宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:47.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.35,0:27:51.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 安琪,听好...  - 我还在生你的气
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.82,0:27:53.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你生我的气?  - 你戴着头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.02,0:27:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,不说你是谁,未免太幼稚了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.46,0:28:01.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一声不吭就跑去宙斯太空站,让我蛮生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:04.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在你知道是怎么回事了吧?  - 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的任务必须在无重力状态执行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.67,0:28:08.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.20,0:28:12.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去太空站出公差,而你不肯见我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.31,0:28:14.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可能是在搜集能量波
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.98,0:28:16.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我现在知道了  - 我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是,我们都很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.95,0:28:27.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,说来听听,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.06,0:28:29.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.82,0:28:32.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你搜集的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.19,0:28:36.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在一项实验中受到幽怪感染
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:40.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 通常没人能活下来  - 你怎么活下来?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.37,0:28:44.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,席德博士用薄膜包住病原体
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.64,0:28:47.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我是第一魂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.41,0:28:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,第二魂是一条鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.18,0:28:50.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,鱼?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,第三魂是我在莫斯科野生保留区,找到的一只鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,第四魂是一只小鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.82,0:29:00.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你试过从外太空追踪麻雀吗?一点都不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.16,0:29:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你一定会很喜欢的  - 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就是在时代广场的那植物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.56,0:29:09.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那不是第六魂吗?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.56,0:29:10.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你跳过一个
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:18.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,第五魂是医院急诊室,垂死的小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.24,0:29:22.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我及时采取样本,但是她...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:29.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟她说万物都有灵魂,狗、猫、树木、小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:31.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,就连地球也有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.05,0:29:35.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉她,她不是死,只是回归到盖雅...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.09,0:29:37.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是地灵
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.49,0:29:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,她跟我说她已准备好接受死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.80,0:29:52.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,她说我不必编故事来安慰她
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.91,0:29:58.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,她才七岁已准备好接受死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.45,0:30:05.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有工作要做,我必须找到第七和第八魂
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.12,0:30:08.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.22,0:30:11.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一点都不信,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:14.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.47,0:30:21.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你才避着我?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:23.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.51,0:30:27.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道我还能活多久
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.58,0:30:29.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.28,0:30:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最好继续我的搜寻
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.47,0:30:54.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾队长...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:59.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,几天前你在旧纽约救回罗博士?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.04,0:31:03.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是的,长官  - 你对她有什么印象?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:06.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,她看来非常有决心和能力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.11,0:31:10.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的锐眼部队暂时被重新分派
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.52,0:31:14.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们要保护罗博士回到荒原
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.96,0:31:15.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:18.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还不了解,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,她若有异常行为就向少校报告
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.10,0:31:24.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,异常行为?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.53,0:31:29.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,她体内有异种感染,我们不知道对她有什么影响
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:32.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,它可能影响她的判断力
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.51,0:31:35.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们也许在操控她的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.81,0:31:39.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军认为罗博士是间谍?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:44.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军在奇怪为何他要跟一个队长解释
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:47.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,她曾长期接触异种细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.75,0:31:50.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果异种侵占她的身体...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.66,0:31:55.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻将她拘捕,并把她带回来接受观察
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.83,0:31:59.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是为了她好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.10,0:32:01.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然了,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:13.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,少校,派手下监视队长的行动
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.21,0:33:52.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我深信这些梦境是一种讯息
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.08,0:33:55.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我不了解...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.25,0:33:59.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,但越来越频繁,这代表一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.22,0:34:03.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就快被体内的幽怪侵占了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.39,0:34:06.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标在土桑市以西50公里
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:08.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽怪密度?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.46,0:34:10.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况不妙,到处都有幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.10,0:34:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这下可好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.17,0:34:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着我,千万别逞强,一切照规矩来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.14,0:34:18.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,照规矩来,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.65,0:34:24.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,(土桑荒原)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.58,0:34:29.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,先在这些地方放置能量浮标...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.28,0:34:33.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就能取得目标,趁幽怪没察觉赶快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.35,0:34:35.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,浮标会把幽怪引来?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:37.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对  - 只是一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.13,0:34:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是307支队的?海恩将军的部下?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.54,0:34:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,到荒原出过任务吗?可能会蛮可怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.27,0:35:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,待会撤离时到第六区,279座标会合
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.67,0:35:30.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到,保持警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.56,0:35:50.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来它们上当了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.38,0:36:09.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,第七魂应该就在残骸后面
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:12.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿怎么会有生物生存下来?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.85,0:36:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.82,0:36:19.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这原是幽怪扫荡任务
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.86,0:36:22.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来应该让战争结束的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:27.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.57,0:36:31.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.31,0:36:34.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:51.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:52.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个生还者
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.13,0:36:55.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,它在这儿干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.90,0:36:57.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望有重返的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:00.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,它是第七魂吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.87,0:37:03.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.08,0:37:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们正接近那个生物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.05,0:37:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 还有多远?  - 很难说,我们很接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.46,0:37:26.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也没看到
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.93,0:37:35.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不要告诉我那是他?  - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.88,0:37:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是他,是他的生化电池
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.88,0:37:49.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能,电池提供能量给我们的武器、堡垒城市...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.98,0:37:51.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,那只是生化能量
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.95,0:37:55.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们用活体组织在制造能量,单细胞生物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.59,0:37:58.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他的电池就是第七魂吗?  - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.63,0:38:00.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,幽怪来袭,收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:01.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,再说一遍?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.03,0:38:03.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽怪来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,莱恩,去拿那士兵的电池
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.52,0:38:25.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要支援
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.96,0:38:33.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那些浮标坏了  - 谢谢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 当然没事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.37,0:38:46.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,不应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.64,0:38:48.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么把它们引来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.88,0:38:50.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,安琪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:57.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们就快追上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.65,0:38:59.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍,你打前锋
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.13,0:39:15.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要开火了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.15,0:39:29.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,带我们逃出去,尼尔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.48,0:39:32.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我也很想,但是...  - 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.55,0:39:59.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.45,0:40:03.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的情况不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:05.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得送她去医院
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.85,0:40:09.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你知道命令  - 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:13.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻拘捕罗博士
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:19.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,把武器放下,这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.90,0:40:21.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们解除你的指挥权
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.10,0:40:24.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你得先杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:26.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,别反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.29,0:41:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿,抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.13,0:42:01.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了,把手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.91,0:42:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,锐眼部队,急右转
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.29,0:42:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼尔,快飞回纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.40,0:42:41.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,锐眼部队从荒原回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.61,0:42:43.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,出了一个状况
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.51,0:42:46.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗博士吸引了幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.55,0:42:49.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们差点回不来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.02,0:42:52.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾队长仍然有指挥权
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.72,0:42:54.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,下达命令
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.42,0:42:57.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要立刻逮捕艾队长和罗博士
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.59,0:43:00.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,有关席德博士能量波论的资料...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.13,0:43:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都给我没收
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.96,0:43:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会不一定会接受
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.03,0:43:08.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就太不幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:12.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,太完美了,队长给了我们一个好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.74,0:43:16.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天他们会向我下跪...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.41,0:43:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢我揪出叛徒...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.05,0:43:22.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且从幽怪手上救出他们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.82,0:43:28.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的状况怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.22,0:43:32.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她快死了  - 你一定有办法救她
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.99,0:43:35.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,安琪在跟六魂作战
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.50,0:43:38.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我必须在她胸匣植入第七魂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.73,0:43:41.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想那胸匣受损了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.67,0:43:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须立刻修复
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.67,0:43:49.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的生命迹象减弱,安琪撑不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.08,0:43:54.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,她需要一个友善的灵魂帮助挽留她
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.81,0:43:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,最适合的人选就是你,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.69,0:44:03.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不明白  - 你不必明白
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.86,0:44:05.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只要陪着她
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.99,0:44:09.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你挽留住她
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.15,0:45:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,安琪,我们在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.72,0:45:05.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形星球
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:07.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.06,0:45:11.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.46,0:45:12.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好像很冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.19,0:45:16.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我几个月来,每晚都有同样的梦境
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.63,0:45:17.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,梦境?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.23,0:45:20.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.27,0:45:24.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的在这儿,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.67,0:45:27.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.21,0:45:33.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,席德将第七魂直接植入你体内
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.21,0:45:35.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你是来精神支持我的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.12,0:45:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,葛雷,你对我真好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:43.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你不知道情况有多严重
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.73,0:45:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好过来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.90,0:45:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么玩意?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.37,0:46:02.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗博士录下她的梦境
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.04,0:46:05.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的梦境跟我有什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.05,0:46:08.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.75,0:46:10.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是了,这就是我的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.12,0:46:13.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,她受到幽怪的操控
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.52,0:46:23.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要用来说服议会发射宙斯炮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.30,0:46:26.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会只顾着躲在堡垒城市...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.83,0:46:29.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,让地球一天一天死去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:32.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们需要有人来推一把
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.61,0:46:35.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,召集你的心腹手下
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.19,0:47:29.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们为什么瞪着我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.56,0:47:31.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们不是瞪着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.68,0:48:23.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.39,0:48:27.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,完了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.52,0:48:30.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,她怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.36,0:48:32.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,她没事,但这只是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.83,0:48:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要找到最后的第八魂才能救她
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.47,0:48:42.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,安琪,你听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.37,0:48:45.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做完梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.21,0:48:48.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道它的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.24,0:48:50.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道幽怪到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.21,0:48:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,别动!你们被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.46,0:49:07.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我逮住他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.16,0:49:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.80,0:49:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我太太和女儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.13,0:49:19.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,在旧金山堡垒城市被幽怪害死
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.97,0:49:21.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有没有提过?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.48,0:49:28.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我试着想像她们的感受...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.48,0:49:32.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着身边的人无缘无故死去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.99,0:49:37.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,最后感觉有什么在你身边...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.36,0:49:39.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,无形的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.46,0:49:41.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,触碰你...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.96,0:49:45.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,伸入你的躯体内...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.83,0:49:49.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也失去了家人,对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.50,0:49:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.17,0:49:54.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我才信任你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.17,0:49:56.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.84,0:49:59.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.15,0:50:06.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,(堡垒主控中心)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.92,0:50:09.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,解除安全密码
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.49,0:50:12.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,围场被破
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.73,0:50:15.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,少校,逮捕他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:19.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别乱来  - 起来,走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.80,0:50:23.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们被解职了,别多问
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.37,0:50:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,降低31段的防护能源
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.37,0:50:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道幽怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.58,0:50:31.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,据我所知...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.21,0:50:35.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要逼迫议会消灭敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.65,0:50:44.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,第一个电管二成五的能量改向
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.69,0:50:48.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,降低31段防护能力
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.73,0:50:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,31段防护罩失效,幽怪进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.07,0:50:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以在密封的空间杀死几只幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.24,0:51:02.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,别紧张,少校,明天一早你就成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.44,0:51:07.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不...  - 你也看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.75,0:51:10.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不确定我看到的,你怎么能确定?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.32,0:51:12.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,请你让她说下去
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.92,0:51:16.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们为什么一直没办法确定...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.89,0:51:21.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,人形大小的幽怪跟庞大幽怪的关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.53,0:51:25.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,它们有什么鬼关系?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.26,0:51:29.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,有人形幽怪、恶心的毛虫幽怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:32.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,会飞的幽怪...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.74,0:51:34.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有巨大肥胖的幽怪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.54,0:51:35.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.74,0:51:38.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是你常跟它们周旋...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.74,0:51:42.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,就知道它们没有关系,那外面是一团乱
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.45,0:51:45.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,大幽怪就像我们的鲸鱼或大象
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.19,0:51:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是侵略部队带鲸鱼大象来干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.82,0:51:53.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,除非那是外星人的诺亚方舟?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.19,0:51:56.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一直以为陨石...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.86,0:52:00.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,是交通工具,也许它不是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.60,0:52:03.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,陨石只是一块他们炸毁星球后...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.67,0:52:04.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,被扔到太空中的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.14,0:52:09.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们怎么能活着通过太空?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.81,0:52:11.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们没存活
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.05,0:52:17.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,这好像有点恐怖的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.95,0:52:19.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.99,0:52:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们根本就赢不了它们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.96,0:52:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的战略都根据一种假设:
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.73,0:52:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,敌人是异形侵略者
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.90,0:52:33.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你想想梦中它们是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.90,0:52:36.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,自从那时候之后,它们只认识痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.90,0:52:38.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们不是侵略兵团
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.00,0:52:40.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们是鬼魂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.58,0:52:43.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,有多少幽怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.04,0:52:45.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,多到一定可以说服议会的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.08,0:52:50.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,示警,立刻派部队去消灭它们
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.68,0:52:53.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,全面警戒、全体动员
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.42,0:52:55.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有很多幽怪来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.42,0:52:56.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.06,0:52:59.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,在31段以外,而且行动迅速
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.19,0:53:01.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.19,0:53:03.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们在管道中
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.76,0:53:06.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟着生化电力一起流窜
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.53,0:53:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能,没有东西可以在这些管子中存活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.90,0:53:14.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一只巨大幽怪正朝这儿冲来,是米达种的,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.35,0:53:23.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.42,0:53:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.43,0:54:14.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.19,0:54:39.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼尔,我们得逃出去,你是高手,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.73,0:54:43.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是钛合金钢柱和雷射光束
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.83,0:54:47.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能就这样施展魔法...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.20,0:54:53.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我很佩服你  - 我也很佩服自己
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.21,0:54:56.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻前往最近的撤退区
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.94,0:54:58.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,立刻前往最近的撤退区
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.18,0:55:02.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该立刻最近的撤退区
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.37,0:55:30.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它们来了  - 别人呢?席德博士!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.21,0:55:32.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,锐眼部队会保护他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.99,0:55:42.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么会看得见它们?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.32,0:55:45.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们身上残留防护罩的电力
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.66,0:55:51.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心后面
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.06,0:56:55.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都上车了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.46,0:58:04.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要找我的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.70,0:58:07.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,它一定是被拖到军事停机棚
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.60,0:58:09.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞不好不是
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.31,0:58:19.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.39,0:58:29.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,快开到月台
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.41,0:58:49.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.51,0:58:51.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要穿越车站
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.54,0:58:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.31,0:58:55.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 对不起,队长  - 车站
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.58,0:58:57.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要冲过去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.32,0:58:58.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是唯一的出路
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.18,0:59:02.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜这会是一个巅簸之旅?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.82,0:59:05.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士,你真会说冷笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.59,0:59:07.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,坐好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.88,0:59:32.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.56,0:59:38.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.32,0:59:41.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人受伤吗?  - 队长
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.96,0:59:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,老天,快说话,中士
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.97,0:59:49.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.20,0:59:51.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 帮我个忙  - 好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.74,0:59:55.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,他会加重伤势的,我们需要适合的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.97,0:59:57.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,工具在我船上
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.74,1:00:02.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我不要打针下药  - 队长?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.38,1:00:03.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听他的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.38,1:00:05.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.15,1:00:07.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我留下来陪他  - 我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:09.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁都别留下来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.92,1:00:12.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 给我一把枪  - 没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.09,1:00:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪给他,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.13,1:00:19.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会回来救你
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.23,1:00:21.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.63,1:00:24.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,听到了,队长,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.34,1:00:26.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.66,1:01:20.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,四轴越野车,棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.26,1:01:24.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以去把莱恩救回来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.53,1:01:27.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是要换电池
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.00,1:01:30.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,停机棚一定有新的电池
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.84,1:01:33.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去停机棚,尼尔,去启动引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.01,1:01:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,安琪和席德博士,启动越野车
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.14,1:01:38.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去塔台开启平台
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.68,1:01:43.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,城市也许沦陷了,但我们不会,我们一定会逃出去
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.26,1:01:56.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.56,1:01:57.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.21,1:02:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.96,1:02:58.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,尼尔,收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.72,1:03:00.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.49,1:03:02.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,这玩意是全自动的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.84,1:03:11.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,航道设定好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.34,1:03:12.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,转动平台
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.31,1:03:18.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,停下来,有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.78,1:03:21.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,太空船连着一辆被拖吊的牵引车
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.58,1:03:23.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能从驾驶舱解开它吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.02,1:03:26.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,请让我到外面解开它
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.52,1:03:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.17,1:03:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,问题在那
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.64,1:03:53.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,控制板被锁住了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.05,1:03:59.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们逃得出去吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.68,1:04:01.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道以前有没有人逃出去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.05,1:04:04.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得有人逃了这么远吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.82,1:04:07.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,第八魂这玩意能消灭幽怪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.99,1:04:10.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许全都是胡扯蛋?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.33,1:04:16.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托你别唠叨了吧?让我专心吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,下面发生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.68,1:04:33.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们搞得定啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.10,1:04:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 尼尔,怎么样?  - 快好了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.53,1:04:50.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们快回去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.27,1:04:54.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,放心,珍在展开强硬政策
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.21,1:04:55.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍,快回答
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.04,1:04:59.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.68,1:05:07.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,可以出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.43,1:05:49.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍,快走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.46,1:05:52.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,珍,快走呀,赶快走
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.76,1:05:54.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,快点离开那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.06,1:06:24.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,防护罩启动了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.96,1:06:26.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪儿?  - 去驾驶舱
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.53,1:06:29.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要倒数发射
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.83,1:06:33.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,太危险了,别去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.06,1:06:59.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在这儿,臭怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.15,1:08:28.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你收到吗?怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.92,1:08:31.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和席德快走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.29,1:08:34.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不,我不能丢下大伙儿  - 大伙儿都死了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.79,1:08:38.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不能丢下你  - 抱歉,你别无选择
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.67,1:08:42.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见,安琪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.81,1:09:22.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,葛雷,快上来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.10,1:11:28.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很想...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.13,1:11:33.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很想相信他们到更好的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.45,1:13:17.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,(宙斯太空站)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.80,1:13:20.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,(确认目的地 获准前进)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.20,1:13:45.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我扩大搜索范围...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.27,1:13:48.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,包括一个之前没找过的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.24,1:13:50.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,陨石坑
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.08,1:13:53.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,好个奇怪的第八魂藏身处
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.38,1:13:55.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,很不可思议
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.21,1:13:57.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,那儿除了幽怪没别的生物可以存活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.72,1:13:58.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.22,1:14:02.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是说第八魂是幽怪
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.59,1:14:05.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我目前不能解释,只要你下去...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.99,1:14:09.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就会明白的...  - 慢着,这是一去不回
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.53,1:14:12.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我就知道你是这么评估我们的机会的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.80,1:14:14.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说错了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.47,1:14:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,我同意,我们也许...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.00,1:14:19.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,无法活着把第八魂萃取回来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.47,1:14:21.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,那为什么还要去试?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.24,1:14:23.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我们不必把第八魂萃取回来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.51,1:14:25.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们无法找到最后一魂...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.51,1:14:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,就直接在陨石坑完成能量波
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.31,1:14:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.95,1:14:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.32,1:14:34.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会设计一个装置...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.42,1:14:38.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,装在安琪身上让她采集第八魂...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.86,1:14:40.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.36,1:14:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后就等着瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.13,1:14:46.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.93,1:14:49.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的计划就是等着瞧?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.54,1:14:54.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,太好了,我也有计划
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.84,1:14:56.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续从轨道扫描地球表面...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.71,1:14:59.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许能在别处找到相容的第八魂
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.98,1:15:02.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我建议下去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.48,1:15:35.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,海恩将军,请问防护罩为什么会失灵?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.01,1:15:38.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽怪对防护罩产生抵抗力...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.05,1:15:42.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是迟早会发生的事
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.69,1:15:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我很高兴看到你和议员们...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.36,1:15:48.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,都安全地撤逃到休士顿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.06,1:15:51.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚的事件是一场悲剧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.00,1:15:54.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,议会重新考量了你对发射宙斯炮的提议
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.23,1:15:56.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.83,1:15:59.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们现在就把发射密码传给你
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.04,1:16:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.71,1:16:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,祝大家好运
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.91,1:16:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备发射宙斯炮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.62,1:16:11.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标是?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.45,1:16:15.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,幽怪陨石坑
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.95,1:16:27.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,(里海山脉 幽怪陨石坑)
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.85,1:16:46.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备降落,3、2、1
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.76,1:16:52.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.46,1:16:57.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在陨石坑上方
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.43,1:16:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.90,1:17:02.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,有太多幽怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.57,1:17:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.64,1:17:09.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,我追踪在陨石坑表面的第八魂
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.31,1:17:13.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,好,那就靠近一点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.68,1:17:55.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,三分钟后发射
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.62,1:17:59.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,开到最强电力,转换自动流量
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.89,1:18:01.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,反制推动器准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.16,1:18:04.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,开启流管锁,一切正常
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.16,1:18:08.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们发现陨石坑有动静
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.14,1:18:12.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,是她
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.70,1:18:13.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,长官?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.01,1:18:16.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,是被敌人控制的叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.74,1:18:18.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续倒数计时
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.71,1:18:21.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一起把它们消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.08,1:18:29.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,接近幽怪了,三十秒后接触
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.39,1:18:31.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,目标锁定
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.09,1:18:34.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,等待你下令发射
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.56,1:18:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全符合,能量波完全符合
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.37,1:18:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了  - 发射
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.37,1:19:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.54,1:19:22.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,是宙斯炮,他们向陨石坑发射宙斯炮
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.27,1:19:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们没事吧?  - 我们吓了一跳,请待命
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.91,1:19:30.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在扫描器上看不到第八魂,你看到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.98,1:19:32.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,第八魂...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.72,1:19:35.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,被消灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.85,1:19:37.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.85,1:19:39.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,不怎么办,任务结束
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.96,1:19:41.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快走吧  - 幽怪来袭
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.56,1:20:15.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.56,1:20:18.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要走就得趁现在
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.78,1:20:31.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,扣紧我们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.22,1:20:43.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我扣不住你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.86,1:20:50.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,无法维持高度
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.40,1:21:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,启动紧急降落程序
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.79,1:21:26.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,快回答我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.46,1:21:29.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.57,1:21:33.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士,你能帮我接太空站吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.94,1:21:38.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么鬼玩意?  - 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.11,1:21:41.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,讯息传送进来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.61,1:21:44.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,海恩将军,请你立刻停火
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.32,1:21:48.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你所看到的是外星人的地灵
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.82,1:21:51.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们的星球被毁灭后降落到地球
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.69,1:21:54.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这从一开始就不是侵略行动
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.63,1:21:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来如此,那我们都在跟什么打仗?异形鬼吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.16,1:22:00.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.30,1:22:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,感到迷惑、失落和愤怒的鬼魂
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.00,1:22:06.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,对,这些鬼都来自盖雅
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.94,1:22:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.77,1:22:12.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形盖雅、地球盖雅,就算我信这套...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.61,1:22:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,地球仍然受到必须被不择手段...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.65,1:22:17.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,消灭掉的侵略者的攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.22,1:22:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,代价是地球也会被毁灭
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.95,1:22:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,异形盖雅遭到攻击会更强大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.95,1:22:28.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然你是受到外星人的控制,我觉得...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.59,1:22:30.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们做对了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.76,1:22:35.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就等着去见你的盖雅吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.40,1:22:38.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,继续开火,直到完全歼灭侵略者
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.11,1:23:17.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,将军,系统过热了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.44,1:23:21.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要不断攻击直到它们全死光
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.55,1:23:24.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不晓得有没有效
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.35,1:23:27.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,有没有效?它们走投无路了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.95,1:23:31.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,胜利就快来临,我命令你发射
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.19,1:23:36.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 系统无法继续发射  - 等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.29,1:23:41.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,防护罩失效,这是等死,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.09,1:24:05.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是个可以留下的好地方
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.63,1:24:16.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么东东?那是我以为的东东吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.90,1:24:18.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,是,这就是盖雅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.40,1:24:20.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这的确不是个可以留下的好地方
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.14,1:24:24.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.48,1:24:28.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,我得跟希德博士通话
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.95,1:25:09.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,希德,你收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.22,1:25:12.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还在,说吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.62,1:25:16.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,盖雅就在我们眼前,听到吗?盖雅
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.16,1:25:21.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,这解释了为什么第八魂会在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.37,1:25:23.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.03,1:25:25.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.00,1:25:28.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一只幽怪接触到我们盖雅产生的生命...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.04,1:25:31.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是它转变成第八魂
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.08,1:25:35.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以它的能量波...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.51,1:25:38.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,才会跟别的幽怪不同
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.88,1:25:41.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是找到新而相容的第八魂...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:44.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,的最佳地点
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.49,1:25:48.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论如何都不要动,留在原地
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.96,1:25:53.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,留在这里可不是件容易的事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.00,1:25:56.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,别对它们任何一个开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.37,1:25:59.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你很可能会毁掉最后一线希望
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.37,1:26:02.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该怎样?叫它们乖一点吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.67,1:26:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,战略是你的专长,队长,不是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.05,1:26:10.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说我收到能量波,你看到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.78,1:26:15.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,那是相容的第八魂,它一定很接近你
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.85,1:26:17.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,哪一个才是?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.22,1:26:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪一个?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.56,1:26:23.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看不出来,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.60,1:26:29.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里变得太挤了,没有时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.23,1:28:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱着新生命的希望...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.76,1:28:06.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,盖雅是否改变了内在的幽怪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.87,1:28:14.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.41,1:28:23.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,快进来,我需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.01,1:28:27.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,你收到吗?能量波完成了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.25,1:28:30.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到了,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.72,1:28:33.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎样找到最后一魂
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.86,1:28:36.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,它找到我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.06,1:28:39.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的天
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.96,1:28:44.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道了,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.27,1:28:46.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不懂,到底是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.07,1:28:49.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,电池发射能量波
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.27,1:28:52.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们会变得手无寸铁  - 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.74,1:28:54.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你们知道在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.02,1:28:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要用防护罩发射能量波
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.35,1:29:00.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,博士说得对,我得到第八魂
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.05,1:29:02.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.62,1:29:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你确定你得到最后的一魂?  - 我很确定
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.09,1:29:09.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道?  - 别担心,一只幽怪告诉我的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.49,1:29:11.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.46,1:29:13.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,启动防护罩
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.44,1:29:22.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有用,赶快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.57,1:29:25.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,这没用的话一切都太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.65,1:29:35.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.98,1:30:01.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把你们打下地狱
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.52,1:30:11.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.53,1:30:16.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,趴下来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.24,1:30:32.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 警告,系统超载  - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.48,1:30:35.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 警告,系统超载  - 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.78,1:30:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,但一定要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.50,1:31:26.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射,快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.73,1:31:28.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射,快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.50,1:31:30.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.78,1:32:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,别丢下我
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.22,1:32:54.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉博士这是一去不回
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.72,1:32:57.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来我说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.69,1:33:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你要撑下去
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.26,1:33:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我仍有能量波
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.39,1:33:04.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们撑的过去的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.27,1:33:11.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 来不及了  - 来得及
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.80,1:33:13.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.38,1:33:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,扶我起来
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.10,1:33:40.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.10,1:33:45.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救过我,我要你救自己
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.47,1:33:47.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不,求求你?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.44,1:33:50.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我这么做,相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.62,1:34:02.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,葛雷,别离开我
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.52,1:34:05.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你一直说死亡并不是终结
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.66,1:34:10.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我终于相信后,别说不是
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.44,1:34:23.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.15,1:36:15.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,好暖啊
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.28,1:45:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,